<title>USA: Roseau ISD 682, Minn., won by Piper Jaffray.</title>
<headline>Roseau ISD 682, Minn., won by Piper Jaffray.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray said it won $8.460 million of Roseau ISD 682, Minn., general obligation school building refunding bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.43 percent.</p>
</text>
